rac{1}{x}.$\n\n![](images/a3/a32495fcca947d01cf8d3218fc5cfc0cce083a34e6fb6b629d92ba9e47039a6e.png)\n\n- Then, stretch the result by a scale factor of $\\frac{4}{5}$ parallel to the $y$-axis to get the graph of $y=\\frac{4}{5x}.$\n\n![](images/ea/ea9bd36b532b46d3edcc99497b77e75288499a4b02239f5d2416cff6a4259478.png)\n\n- Translate it by $3$ units up to get the graph of $y=\\frac{4}{5x}+3.$\n\n![](images/e6/e6798ba049ab7040eec51d2da525d3383816578423e11384ced1f3665a2e50fd.png)"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186562395 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186068780 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "308f3685-0a90-56f3-9653-a83cec4286d2" :knowledge-point/title "Solving for Some Unknowns Given the Graph of a Transformed Reciprocal Function"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "24d40f9b-0372-5ede-9fdd-abafcda394fd" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "2" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186561679} {:answer/id #uuid "40d40356-40b7-5340-9313-8f98a64c0983" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "4" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186561740} {:answer/id #uuid "61bb5b4e-5071-54e6-9b66-6c673dd707e4" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "3" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186561818} {:answer/id #uuid "b7a03d0f-dc32-5657-be13-40db2364f8ad" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-3" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186562043} {:answer/id #uuid "b825340d-a071-5920-ba75-a41a15299a12" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-4" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186562045}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "b7a03d0f-dc32-5657-be13-40db2364f8ad" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-3" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186562043} :answer-field/id #uuid "1915a924-8b95-58f0-84a6-218999796b6c" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045493 :db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186562235}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045485 :db/ident :question.difficulty/easy} :question/id #uuid "0afab3eb-630e-58a0-8be5-5f624db42ba7" :question/math-academy-id "q-113475" :question/problem "![](images/fc/fc0ad365fca91e61da2e7f09197299ea6130018d7490873d3568231be360b481.png)\n\nThe diagram above shows the graph of $y=\\frac{a}{x}.$ What is the value of $a?$" :question/worked-solution "Notice that the point $(3,-1)$ lies on the graph.\n\nSubstituting its coordinates into the equation $y=\\frac{a}{x},$ we obtain \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}-1=\\frac{a}{3}\\,⟹\\,a=-3.\\end{aligned}\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186562424 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186068780 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "308f3685-0a90-56f3-9653-a83cec4286d2" :knowledge-point/title "Solving for Some Unknowns Given the Graph of a Transformed Reciprocal Function"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "85a7519b-236e-5167-bf36-7acc2fbd12a6" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{3}{2}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186561916}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "85a7519b-236e-5167-bf36-7acc2fbd12a6" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{3}{2}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186561916} :answer-field/id #uuid "40d7c4e5-3f33-5e32-a43f-784a1408b1a6" :answer-field/key "field-3" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045492 :db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186562266} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "447610bd-011b-5941-900a-08f48f1ec880" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "4" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186561751}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "447610bd-011b-5941-900a-08f48f1ec880" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "4" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186561751} :answer-field/id #uuid "4f66befd-be45-5c10-a46a-921be5c7d226" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045492 :db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186562273} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "153166f5-8ea1-5f50-8ca0-0ac7dbf239d6" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-1" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186561643}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "153166f5-8ea1-5f50-8ca0-0ac7dbf239d6" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-1" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186561643} :answer-field/id #uuid "887368ab-3a85-523d-a904-ef84af68ef2e" :answer-field/key "field-2" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045492 :db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186562310}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045486 :db/ident :question.difficulty/hard} :question/id #uuid "3ce08e84-b291-5c5a-ac58-9e142f6fb8a7" :question/math-academy-id "q-270753" :question/problem "![](images/84/84c4df89c98cd103049ac6161c5d3e4eec258d3ecb3c1af94bf7d300f9342d22.png)\n\nThe graph represents the function $y=\\frac{a}{x-b}+k.$ What are the values of $a,$ $b,$ and $k?$\n\n$a=$\n{{field-1}},$\\,b=$\n{{field-2}},$\\,k=$\n{{field-3}}" :question/worked-solution "First, notice that the horizontal asymptote of the graph is $y=1.5,$ while the vertical asymptote is $x=-1.$ This means that $k=1.5$ and $b=-1,$ and we can re-write our function as\n\n$$\ny=\\frac{a}{x-(-1)}+1.5=\\frac{a}{x+1}+1.5.\n$$\n\nAlso, we are given that the point $(1,3.5)$ lies on the graph. Substituting its coordinates into the equation above, we obtain\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}y & =\\frac{a}{x+1}+1.5 \\\\ 3.5 & =\\frac{a}{1+1}+1.5 \\\\ 2 & =\\frac{a}{2} \\\\ a & =4.\\end{aligned}\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186562477 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186068814 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "52e11164-1929-594d-9f9e-460f6469421d" :knowledge-point/title "Graphing a Stretched Negative Reciprocal Function"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "3901636e-8711-59fa-95da-dbb2e05a6300" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045497 :db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "images/ef/ef27614aef03b1f1396a346e2b76eb17b65a3d07ed43ecc2a4c47fb4fdd02894.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186561726} {:answer/id #uuid "6fd30783-348c-5942-a986-7b78f40ac44d" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045497 :db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "images/6c/6c7b719326bfa1a4b53fdf2bce3f6e7f1dafe5de2c994ffb4951a6d79af78707.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186561858} {:answer/id #uuid "7a06b367-5eab-5065-8142-84cad78fcfbd" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045497 :db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "images/2d/2dc7eb6d95c2bba3a4465a4631a0443addabf3ae728a7c99839a924fdf194eea.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186561885} {:answer/id #uuid "989c17c7-89bc-5b99-ad94-6a8b1118df11" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045497 :db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "images/22/22a5600f9104cbb34a4274f09af767862e7b7bc21dc2edbca2a55e5207947142.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186561959} {:answer/id #uuid "ea9a6949-fbd4-547e-90dc-a32dfb549a7a" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045497 :db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "images/d7/d79bee1dd235ec65dd14b1c99702b078f91654465dbc68b62237b09636ea8fa3.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186562169}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "989c17c7-89bc-5b99-ad94-6a8b1118df11" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045497 :db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "images/22/22a5600f9104cbb34a4274f09af767862e7b7bc21dc2edbca2a55e5207947142.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186561959} :answer-field/id #uuid "080a889e-2116-5688-8643-828a724c1108" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045493 :db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186562223}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045487 :db/ident :question.difficulty/moderate} :question/id #uuid "b235c15c-2f59-5a6f-acea-69e0a744bdcd" :question/math-academy-id "q-97964" :question/problem "Which of the following is the graph of $y=-\\frac{2}{5x}?$" :question/worked-solution "To plot $y=-\\frac{2}{5x},$ we apply the following steps:\n\n- Take the curve $y=-\\frac{1}{x}.$\n\n![](images/d5/d5d93e12275c683e0a56f0ec9a0c99540a7774879cd0f8fa69151ddba68a44fa.png)\n\n- Stretch the result by a scale factor of $\\frac{2}{5}$ parallel to the $y$-axis to get the graph of $y=-\\frac{2}{5x}.$\n\n![](images/22/22a5600f9104cbb34a4274f09af767862e7b7bc21dc2edbca2a55e5207947142.png)"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186395370 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186068779 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "4640f978-9caa-5960-bec4-f153a1b4cc5d" :knowledge-point/title "Graphing a Transformed Reciprocal Function"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "5ac99bf6-327a-5511-b7a4-734f9c76a5be" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045497 :db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "images/b9/b9683bcc1b559505141d45b9007ef45011adee98b33730ffad1876a462d9abc1.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186395372} {:answer/id #uuid "d352e845-d658-517b-b4e5-85b07a890741" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045497 :db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "images/80/804eac3df07358686b859f20630acc5344f82ff0c71dc80e6320ab2f7b2313f2.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186395373} {:answer/id #uuid "b31d701f-35d2-53fb-9bb7-6e53d677c6e4" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045497 :db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "images/a2/a2af9de8793d7f2e527721b3874ac6d49d25d0a1e496d3cd62ecf2710b4ab932.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186395374} {:answer/id #uuid "91f3d40c-2faf-5526-b31d-531299ba0057" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045497 :db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "images/c5/c52f568868328061237d43e4650180321ec4a40e886a62f4a678f0276afe821b.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186395375} {:answer/id #uuid "d4ab1f08-3af2-5eaf-b009-717e15